d 'ILOSTAT': module to Access ILOSTAT statistics and metadata 
d
d      ilostat retrieves ILOSTAT data and metadata from the ILOSTAT
d Plumber API. Data    are returned as native Stata DTA by default.
d There is no persistent local cache,	 and no Python, R, curl or
d PowerShell dependency. Requests include    channel=ilostat-stata.
d    Dataset identifiers such as FRA_A are automatically routed to
d the reference-area	segment. Use by() to select a segment
d explicitly. Other identifiers default to    the indicator
d segment.    Code filters accept space-separated values. The API
d applies its partial-matching	  semantics. Label filters accept
d comma-separated quoted values; commas inside	  quotes are
d preserved. Label filters are applied locally after labels have
d been	  retrieved.	metadata returns a catalogue summary, not
d the full dataset-specific JSON    metadata. datasetdic returns
d classification values available in the selected    dataset. 
d
d KW: International Labour Organization
d KW: ILO
d KW: data management
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261125
d
d Author: David Bescond,  International Labour Organization
d Support: email bescond@@ilo.org
d
f ilostat.ado
f ilostat.sthlp
f ilostat_datasetdic.sthlp
f ilostat_info.sthlp
f ilostat_metadata.sthlp
f ilostat_quickstart.do
f ilostat_toc.sthlp
